# Sprint 28 — Threat Hunting & Hypothesis-Driven Investigation

**Status:** Complete 
**Hunt ID:** HUNT-001 
**Primary Finding:** HF-001 
**Detection Opportunity:** DET-OPP-001 
**Environment:** corp.lab 
**SIEM:** Splunk Enterprise

