## Authentication Baseline

Successful authentication activity was reviewed using:

```spl
index=* EventCode=4624
| stats count by host
| sort - count
```

Network authentication was then isolated using:

```spl
index=* EventCode=4624 LogonType=3
| where IpAddress!="-" AND IpAddress!="127.0.0.1" AND IpAddress!="::1"
| stats count by host TargetUserName IpAddress
| sort - count
```

This allowed remote network authentication to be reviewed independently from the broader population of successful Windows logons.

---

## Authentication Sequence Hunt

Successful and failed authentication events were reviewed chronologically.

```spl
index=* (EventCode=4624 OR EventCode=4625)
| eval auth_result=if(EventCode=4625,"FAILURE","SUCCESS")
| sort _time
| table _time host TargetUserName IpAddress LogonType auth_result
```

The objective was to identify patterns such as:

```text
Authentication Failure
        |
        v
Authentication Failure
        |
        v
Authentication Failure
        |
        v
Successful Authentication
```

Such a sequence does not independently establish compromise but can provide useful context for additional investigation.

