## Remote Network Logon Hunt

The tuned DET-006 methodology was reused as a threat-hunting query:

```spl
index=* EventCode=4624 LogonType=3
| where IpAddress!="-" AND IpAddress!="127.0.0.1" AND IpAddress!="::1"
| sort _time
| table _time host TargetUserName IpAddress WorkstationName LogonType
```

Remote authentication was also grouped by source and account:

```spl
index=* EventCode=4624 LogonType=3
| where IpAddress!="-" AND IpAddress!="127.0.0.1" AND IpAddress!="::1"
| stats count dc(host) as target_hosts values(host) as targets by IpAddress TargetUserName
| sort - target_hosts
```

This provides a hunting method for identifying accounts or systems authenticating across multiple endpoints.

