## PowerShell Hunt

PowerShell Script Block Logging was reviewed using Event ID 4104.

Potentially interesting characteristics were searched using:

```spl
index=* EventCode=4104
("EncodedCommand" OR "FromBase64String" OR "Invoke-" OR "DownloadString" OR "Hidden")
| sort _time
| table _time host Message
```

This search is intended for analyst investigation and does not independently classify matching PowerShell activity as malicious.

---

## Persistence Hunt

Scheduled-task telemetry was reviewed using:

```spl
index=* EventCode=4698
| sort _time
| table _time host SubjectUserName TaskName
```

Because Event ID 4698 availability had previously been inconsistent in the lab, additional process-oriented searches were included:

```spl
index=* ("schtasks.exe" OR "Register-ScheduledTask")
| sort _time
| table _time host _raw
```

This provided an alternate hunting path where direct scheduled-task audit telemetry was unavailable.

---

## Privilege Modification Hunt

Privileged group membership activity was reviewed using:

```spl
index=* EventCode=4728
| sort _time
| table _time host SubjectUserName MemberName GroupName
```

Domain Admins activity could be isolated using:

```spl
index=* EventCode=4728 "Domain Admins"
| sort _time
| table _time host SubjectUserName MemberName GroupName
```

