## Controlled Hunt Simulation

A controlled sequence was generated to validate the hunt methodology.

The sequence consisted of:

```text
Remote Network Authentication
        |
        v
PowerShell Execution
```

Remote network authentication was generated from WIN11-01 to WIN11-02 using:

```cmd
net use \\WIN11-02\IPC$ /user:corp\tadmin *
```

Controlled PowerShell activity was then generated on WIN11-02:

```powershell
$cmd='Write-Output "Sprint28 HUNT001 Test"'
```

```powershell
$encoded=[Convert]::ToBase64String([Text.Encoding]::Unicode.GetBytes($cmd))
```

```powershell
powershell.exe -EncodedCommand $encoded
```

The test produced:

```text
Sprint28 HUNT001 Test
```

