Neither component of HF-001 independently established malicious activity.

```text
Remote Network Logon
        |
        +---- Alone ----> Requires Context

PowerShell Execution
        |
        +---- Alone ----> Requires Context
```

When evaluated chronologically:

```text
Remote Network Authentication
        |
        v
PowerShell Execution
```

the relationship provides higher-value investigative context.

This demonstrated the benefit of hunting across telemetry sources rather than reviewing individual events in isolation.

